B.YT=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,1,"F and J: Anchor Keys","Place your index fingers on F and J \u2014 the two keys with small bumps.","ff jjj jfj fff jff ff ff fff jfj fff ff jjf jjj fjf jfj ffj fj fjf jjj jfj fjf fff fff jjj fff fff jjj jj jjj fff",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","fj","Left index: F \xb7 Right index: J","Feel the small bumps on F and J. Rest your index fingers there and your thumbs on the space bar. Sit straight, keep your wrists relaxed and your eyes on the screen, not the keyboard.")
